# TokenAccount Spec

TokenAccount records protocol accounting units for an Entity.

```json
{
  "account_id": "acct_001",
  "entity_id": "skill_001",
  "cp_balance": 100,
  "ai_credit_balance": 50,
  "compute_credit_balance": 20,
  "pocp_token_balance_internal": 0,
  "staked_balance": 0,
  "pending_rewards": 0,
  "slashed_amount": 0
}
```

Tokenized measurement does not mean immediate public token issuance.
